{"cwd": "/sandbox/runs/harbor-dispatch-sonnet5/runs/eval-INC-203-r2-holdout/harbor-dispatch", "isSidechain": false, "message": {"content": [{"text": "Fixed INC-203: `verifiedGrossMassTonnes` in `src/cargo/manifest.ts` was ignoring `tareKg`, so declared VGM was lighter than the weighbridge by the container's own weight. Now it sums cargo + tare (22200 kg → 22.2 t for the example in the ticket), and `manifestWeightTonnes` inherits the fix automatically. Added a test covering the exact acceptance-criteria numbers; full `npm run check` suite passes (27/27).\n\nWould you like me to commit this fix?", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CfVACiE4CkKtdCJTfpZy5", "model": "claude-sonnet-5", "role": "assistant"}, "sessionId": "3f10461c-deda-4a30-ba2a-edabf05bf181", "timestamp": "2026-09-28T03:52:46.480Z", "type": "assistant"}
